---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Residential Designer & House Plans in DeLand, FL"
description: Residential designer in DeLand, FL. Custom house plans, additions, and permit-ready drawings for Volusia County homeowners and builders.
permalink: /
---
<section class="hero-blueprint py-14 pb-10">
  <div class="mx-auto grid w-[min(1120px,calc(100%-2rem))] grid-cols-1 items-center gap-10 md:grid-cols-2">
    <div>
      <h1 class="mb-1.5 font-serif text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3.1rem)] leading-tight text-navy">Award-Winning Residential Designer in DeLand, FL</h1>
      <p class="mb-5 text-xl font-bold text-brand-deep">Blueprints By Design</p>
      <div class="mb-6">
        <p class="mb-4"><strong>Volusia/Flagler Business Report</strong><br>
        2015 Largest Homebuilders<br>
        Atlas Homes and Blueprints By Design</p>
        <p class="mb-4"><strong>West Volusia Realty Association</strong><br>
        2014 Parade Of Homes<br>
        2014 Reserve Grand Award<br>
        2014 Best Value Award<br>
        Bethany Model Home</p>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-0 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a class="btn" href="/contact/">FREE Quote</a>
        <a class="btn-ghost" href="/home-design/">Home Design Services</a>
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4">See all design services under “Home Design Services” in our top navigation.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      {% youtube "GcK3D5y_FRA", "Blueprints By Design introduction" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="recent-projects" class="mx-auto w-[min(1120px,calc(100%-2rem))] py-10" aria-labelledby="recent-projects-heading">
  <h2 id="recent-projects-heading" class="mb-5 font-serif text-[clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.2rem)] text-navy">Recent Projects</h2>
  <ul class="m-0 grid list-none grid-cols-1 gap-4 p-0 sm:grid-cols-2">
    {% for project in projects %}
    <li>
      <button type="button" class="block w-full cursor-pointer border-0 bg-white p-2 text-left text-inherit shadow-[0_12px_32px_rgb(11_28_46_/_0.08)] hover:outline hover:outline-2 hover:outline-brand focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-brand" data-project-open aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="View larger photo: {{ project.alt }}">
        <img class="block aspect-[3/2] w-full object-cover" src="{{ project.src }}" alt="{{ project.alt }}" width="1536" height="1024">
      </button>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>

  <dialog id="project-dialog" class="m-auto w-[min(1100px,calc(100%-1.5rem))] max-h-[100dvh] max-w-none overflow-auto border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-white backdrop:bg-navy/80" aria-label="Recent project" aria-describedby="project-dialog-caption">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
      <button type="button" class="grid h-11 w-11 shrink-0 cursor-pointer place-items-center rounded-full border-0 bg-white/20 text-2xl text-white hover:bg-white/35" data-project-prev aria-label="Previous project">‹</button>
      <figure class="relative m-0 min-w-0 flex-1 bg-navy">
        <button type="button" class="absolute top-2 right-2 z-10 grid h-10 w-10 cursor-pointer place-items-center rounded-full border-0 bg-navy/80 text-2xl leading-none text-white hover:bg-black" data-project-close aria-label="Close">×</button>
        <img class="mx-auto block max-h-[78dvh] w-full object-contain" data-project-image src="" alt="" width="1536" height="1024">
        <figcaption id="project-dialog-caption" class="px-3 py-2 text-right text-sm text-white/80" aria-live="polite"><span class="sr-only" data-project-label></span><span data-project-status></span></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <button type="button" class="grid h-11 w-11 shrink-0 cursor-pointer place-items-center rounded-full border-0 bg-white/20 text-2xl text-white hover:bg-white/35" data-project-next aria-label="Next project">›</button>
    </div>
  </dialog>
</section>
<script src="/assets/js/projects.js"></script>

<section class="mx-auto grid w-[min(1120px,calc(100%-2rem))] grid-cols-1 gap-5 py-10 pb-14 md:grid-cols-3">
