    <h2 class="mb-2.5 font-serif text-[1.35rem] text-navy"><a class="text-inherit no-underline after:absolute after:inset-0 after:content-[''] focus-visible:outline-none" href="/reviews/">Reviews</a></h2>
    <img class="mb-3 block w-32" src="/assets/images/five-stars.png" alt="Five stars" width="160" height="37">
    <p class="m-0 text-muted">Learn more about what our customers have to say about our quality and commitment to providing the best in residential design.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="relative bg-white p-5 shadow-[0_12px_32px_rgb(11_28_46_/_0.08)] hover:outline hover:outline-2 hover:outline-brand has-focus-visible:outline has-focus-visible:outline-2 has-focus-visible:outline-brand">
    <h2 class="mb-2.5 font-serif text-[1.35rem] text-navy"><a class="text-inherit no-underline after:absolute after:inset-0 after:content-[''] focus-visible:outline-none" href="/ralph-paiva/">Ralph Paiva</a></h2>
